<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa in ittah Gaius, thutah a ka it mama kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />It aw, na hinna hagau in lungnopna anga mabang a, na gamtatna zousie a hamphatna na nga theina ding leh na chidam theina dingin thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen unaute ahing pei ua, thutah zui a na umdan bang a, thutah nangma a aten thu ahing theisah tahun ka lungdam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tate thutah ah a um uh chi ka zah sanga kipahna lienzaw ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />It aw, unaute tung leh mikhuolte tunga na silbawl pouma gin umtahin na bawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaun hattuomte mai ah na itna theipimi a pangin agenta uhi. Amaute akhuolzinna ua Pasianmi bangtaha na makai zel leh a bawl hoi na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amin zieh a Jentelte kunga kipat bangma lalou a peidoh ahi zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin thutah a kipanpituo nasemte ihitheina dingun, tam bang mite ingai ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hattuomte kungah lai ka hing giel a, hinanleh alah ua, tungtuon utpa Diotrephes in koute ahing ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka hing haw chiengin asilbawlte ka theidohsah ding hi, ka tung ua thu gilou genna akamtam dan, tua zong hunsalouin ama mamain unaute apom nuom sih a, apom nuomte nangawn akham nalai a, hattuom apat anotdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka it aw, sil gilou bawlte umdan la sinlen, sil hoi bawlzaw in, Silhoi bawl mi pen Pasian a kipan ahia, hinanleh silgilou bawlmi in Pasian amu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Demetrius in mi zousie apat leh Thutah akipat in zong patat alaw hi, ahi, kouten zong ka theipi uhi. Tualeh ka theipina u’pen adih ahi chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gel ding tampi ka nei hi, hinanleh laipeh leh laitui in na kung uah ka giel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh sawtlou kaal in ka hing kimupi dinga, kimai tuo in ikihou ding ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kungah lungmuonna um hen. I lawmten mangpha hing hah uhi. I lawmte amin chiet uh louin ka nousiet hi, hing na genpiehin.
  </para>
</usx>
